Subject: [PATCH] Photo: the empty stage as in the approved frames (header,
 four dashed photos), no older-takes strip
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Run 659 side-by-side (Mac integrator): the empty stage was one tall card with no
header, and the earlier-takes strip showed under it. Now "Photo" and "Zelphira ·
Hoodie · 4 photos" (or "Nothing generated yet"), four dashed photo shapes, "Your
photos appear here" and the run's line; Photo never shows the older-takes strip
(its run has its own strip). photo_empty_stage now also requires the frame's empty
stage to be drawn.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Py2rxoXQmfbR7CXwb939GC
